{"version": 1, "recorded_at": "2026-07-05T09:22:41Z", "prompt": "帮我做一个 200mm 长、20mm 高、20mm 宽悬臂梁的模态分析，看前 5 阶固有频率", "backend": "template", "abaqus_real": true, "workdir": "<recording-workdir>\\artifacts\\replay_recordings\\20260705_172209", "chapters": {"plan_a": "copilot-393e2bb0"}, "kpis": {"first_frequency_hz": 360.62, "job_name": "Copilot_Modal_Job", "model": "Copilot_Modal", "natural_frequencies_hz": [360.62, 360.62, 2175.7, 2175.7, 2847.8], "status": "COMPLETED"}, "frames": [{"dt": 0.0, "kind": "chat", "role": "user", "text": "帮我做一个 200mm 长、20mm 高、20mm 宽悬臂梁的模态分析，看前 5 阶固有频率"}, {"dt": 0.006, "kind": "plan", "plan": {"session_id": "copilot-393e2bb0", "backend": "template", "intent": "create_abaqus_model", "user_summary": "建立一个悬臂梁模态分析模型，提取前 5 阶固有频率。", "model_type": "cantilever_modal", "needs_clarification": false, "clarification_questions": [], "actions": [{"action": "create_cantilever_model", "title": "创建悬臂梁几何与材料（含密度）", "rationale": "模态分析需要质量：钢材密度 7.85e-9 t/mm^3，单位制 mm-N-MPa-s，频率结果即为 Hz。", "params": {"length_mm": 200.0, "height_mm": 20.0, "width_mm": 20.0, "material": "steel", "model_name": "Copilot_Modal", "analysis": "modal"}, "abaqus_python": "from abaqus import *\nfrom abaqusConstants import *\nfrom odbAccess import openOdb\nimport json\nimport mesh\nCOPILOT_MODEL_NAME = 'Copilot_Modal'\nCOPILOT_PART_NAME = 'Beam'\nCOPILOT_INSTANCE_NAME = 'Beam-1'\nCOPILOT_LENGTH = 200.000000\nCOPILOT_HEIGHT = 20.000000\nCOPILOT_WIDTH = 20.000000\nif COPILOT_MODEL_NAME in mdb.models.keys():\n    del mdb.models[COPILOT_MODEL_NAME]\nmodel = mdb.Model(name=COPILOT_MODEL_NAME)\nsketch = model.ConstrainedSketch(name='beam_profile', sheetSize=max(500.0, COPILOT_LENGTH * 2.0))\nsketch.rectangle(point1=(0.0, -COPILOT_HEIGHT / 2.0), point2=(COPILOT_LENGTH, COPILOT_HEIGHT / 2.0))\npart = model.Part(name=COPILOT_PART_NAME, dimensionality=THREE_D, type=DEFORMABLE_BODY)\npart.BaseSolidExtrude(sketch=sketch, depth=COPILOT_WIDTH)\nmaterial = model.Material(name='Steel')\nmaterial.Elastic(table=((210000.0, 0.3),))\nmaterial.Density(table=((7.85e-09,),))\nmodel.HomogeneousSolidSection(name='SteelSection', material='Steel')\nall_cells = part.Set(cells=part.cells[:], name='ALL_CELLS')\npart.SectionAssignment(region=all_cells, sectionName='SteelSection')\npart.seedPart(size=max(2.0, COPILOT_HEIGHT / 2.0), deviationFactor=0.1, minSizeFactor=0.1)\npart.setElementType(regions=(part.cells[:],), elemTypes=(mesh.ElemType(elemCode=C3D8R, elemLibrary=STANDARD),))\npart.generateMesh()\nassembly = model.rootAssembly\nassembly.DatumCsysByDefault(CARTESIAN)\nassembly.Instance(name=COPILOT_INSTANCE_NAME, part=part, dependent=ON)\nmodel.FrequencyStep(name='ModalStep', previous='Initial', numEigen=5)\n"}, {"action": "apply_boundary_condition", "title": "固定左端（悬臂边界）", "rationale": "一端固支的经典模态工况，一阶弯曲频率可对照 (1.875)^2/2π·√(EI/ρAL^4) 解析解。", "params": {"support": "cantilever_modal", "fixed_face": "left"}, "abaqus_python": "model = mdb.models[COPILOT_MODEL_NAME]\nassembly = model.rootAssembly\ninst = assembly.instances[COPILOT_INSTANCE_NAME]\ntol = 1.0e-3\nleft_faces = inst.faces.getByBoundingBox(xMin=-tol, xMax=tol)\nif len(left_faces) == 0:\n    raise RuntimeError('Copilot could not find the left fixed face')\nassembly.Set(faces=left_faces, name='LEFT_FIXED_FACE')\nmodel.EncastreBC(name='BC_Left_Fixed', createStepName='Initial', region=assembly.sets['LEFT_FIXED_FACE'])\n"}, {"action": "submit_job_or_prepare_run", "title": "提交模态作业并提取前 5 阶频率", "rationale": "Lanczos 提取前 5 阶固有频率，写入结果 JSON。", "params": {"job_name": "Copilot_Modal_Job", "run_policy": "submit_and_extract_frequencies"}, "abaqus_python": "COPILOT_JOB_NAME = 'Copilot_Modal_Job'\nif COPILOT_JOB_NAME in mdb.jobs.keys():\n    del mdb.jobs[COPILOT_JOB_NAME]\nmdb.Job(name=COPILOT_JOB_NAME, model=COPILOT_MODEL_NAME, description='AbaqusAgent Copilot modal analysis')\nmdb.saveAs(pathName=COPILOT_JOB_NAME + '.cae')\nmdb.jobs[COPILOT_JOB_NAME].submit(consistencyChecking=ON)\nmdb.jobs[COPILOT_JOB_NAME].waitForCompletion()\n# job.status can be None in noGUI kernels, so trust the solver's .sta verdict\njob_status = str(mdb.jobs[COPILOT_JOB_NAME].status)\nif job_status not in ('COMPLETED',):\n    sta_text = ''\n    try:\n        _sta = open(COPILOT_JOB_NAME + '.sta', 'r')\n        try:\n            sta_text = _sta.read()\n        finally:\n            _sta.close()\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n    if 'COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY' in sta_text:\n        job_status = 'COMPLETED'\nif job_status != 'COMPLETED':\n    raise RuntimeError('Abaqus job %s aborted (status %s); see the .msg/.sta logs'\n                       % (COPILOT_JOB_NAME, job_status))\nodb = openOdb(COPILOT_JOB_NAME + '.odb')\nfrequencies = []\nfor frame in odb.steps['ModalStep'].frames:\n    freq = getattr(frame, 'frequency', None)\n    if freq is not None and freq > 0.0:\n        frequencies.append(float(freq))\nodb.close()\nresult = {\n    'job_name': COPILOT_JOB_NAME,\n    'status': 'COMPLETED',\n    'natural_frequencies_hz': frequencies[:5],\n    'first_frequency_hz': frequencies[0] if frequencies else None,\n    'model': COPILOT_MODEL_NAME,\n}\nwith open(COPILOT_JOB_NAME + '_copilot_result.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(result, f, indent=2, sort_keys=True)\nprint('ABAQUS_AGENT_COPILOT_RESULT ' + json.dumps(result, sort_keys=True))\n"}], "expected_outputs": ["前 5 阶固有频率 (Hz)", "一阶弯曲频率（可对照解析解）", "求解日志是否报错"], "safety_notes": ["模板模式使用默认尺寸和材料；真实项目执行前请确认单位、截面和载荷。"], "assistant_message": "我会按 3 步操作 Abaqus：创建悬臂梁几何与材料（含密度）、固定左端（悬臂边界）、提交模态作业并提取前 5 阶频率。你确认后我再执行。", "raw_assistant_text": ""}}, {"dt": 0.006, "kind": "chat", "role": "assistant", "text": "我会按 3 步操作 Abaqus：创建悬臂梁几何与材料（含密度）、固定左端（悬臂边界）、提交模态作业并提取前 5 阶频率。你确认后我再执行。（后端：template）"}, {"dt": 0.014, "kind": "session", "session": {"session_id": "copilot-393e2bb0", "backend": "template", "user_summary": "建立一个悬臂梁模态分析模型，提取前 5 阶固有频率。", "action_count": 3, "pending_count": 3, "completed_count": 0, "results": [], "errors": [], "kpis": null, "model_state_at": null, "viewport_at": null, "execution"